==Usage== <!--T:6-->

<!--T:7-->
# Select two [[Image:Silk_CubicSurface_64.svg|16px]] [[Silk_CubicSurface_64|blended edge surfaces]]
# There are several ways to invoke the command.
#* Press the {{Button|[[Image:Silk_SubGrid63_2Surf64.svg|16px]] SubGrid63_2Surf64}} button.
#* Select the {{MenuCommand|Silk → [[Image:Silk_SubGrid63_2Surf64.svg|16px]] SubGrid63_2Surf64}} option from the menu.
# A multi corner sub-grid, a '''SubGrid63_2Surf64''' object, is created.

== Properties == <!--T:8-->

<!--T:9-->
See also: [[Property_View|Property View]].

<!--T:10-->
A multi corner sub-grid, a '''SubGrid63_2Surf64''' object, is derived from a [[Part_Feature|Part feature]], or more precise a {{Incode|Part::FeaturePython}} object, and inherits all its properties. It also has the following additional properties:

=== Data === <!--T:11-->

<!--T:12-->
{{Properties_Title|SubGrid63_2Surf64}}

<!--T:13-->
* {{PropertyData|Legs|Part::PropertyGeometryList}}: Poles.
* {{PropertyData|Surf_0|Link}}: First reference 6X4 surface.
* {{PropertyData|Surf_1|Link}}: Second reference 6X4 surface.
* {{PropertyData|Weights|FloatList}}: Weights.


